<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to return from Berlin G7 on Feb 10.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to return from Berlin G7 on Feb 10.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will leave for the Group of Seven (G7) meeting of finance ministers and central bankers on February 7 and return on February 10, a BOJ statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>The G7 meeting is scheduled to be held on February 8 in Berlin.</p>
</text>
